        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "I recently visited the PC Chandra Jewellers Serampore branch and had a wonderful experience. The collection, especially their necklaces, is elegant and well-crafted. I purchased a necklace and was very happy with the quality and design.\n\nA special mention to the staff—they were extremely polite, professional, and helpful throughout my visit. They patiently guided me with the designs, shared the details clearly, and ensured a smooth billing process.\n\nOverall, great experience with both the product and service. Highly recommended if you're looking for good jewellery with excellent customer support.",
